Task 1: Run assert tasks
Description Task 1: Run the assert tasks defined in `assert.yml` on localhost, only once.

Task 2: Install vsftpd package
Description Task 2: Install the `vsftpd` package using the package manager.

Task 3: Configure vsftpd using a template
Description Task 3: Configure `vsftpd` by copying the template file `vsftpd.conf.j2` to the destination file specified by the variable `vsftpd_configuration_file`. Set the owner to root, group to root, and permissions to the value of `vsftpd_configuration_file_mode`. Notify the handler `Restart vsftpd` when the template changes.

Task 4: Start and enable vsftpd service
Description Task 4: Start the `vsftpd` service and enable it to start on boot.


- Last generated (faulty) playbook:
---
- name: Run assert tasks
  import_tasks: assert.yml
  hosts: localhost
  run_once: true

- name: Install vsftpd package
  package:
    name: vsftpd
    state: present

- name: Configure vsftpd using a template
  template:
    src: vsftpd.conf.j2
    dest: "{{ vsftpd_configuration_file }}"
    owner: root
    group: root
    mode: "{{ vsftpd_configuration_file_mode }}"
  notify: Restart vsftpd

- name: Start and enable vsftpd service
  service:
    name: vsftpd
    state: started
    enabled: true


