Task 1: Import assert.yml
Description Task 1: Include the assert.yml task file, running it only once on localhost.

Task 2: Configure apk
Description Task 2: Configure the apk package manager. This includes updating the cache and upgrading all software if the system uses apk. The `Reboot` handler is notified after upgrade.

Task 3: Configure apt
Description Task 3: Configure the apt package manager. This includes preventing upgrades for a list of packages defined in `update_excluded_packages`, updating the cache and upgrading all software if the system uses apt. The `Reboot` handler is notified after upgrade. Includes apt autoremove if enabled.

Task 4: Update all software (dnf)
Description Task 4: Update all software using the dnf package manager, excluding packages listed in `update_excluded_packages`. The `Reboot` handler is notified after upgrade. This task is executed when the package manager is dnf or dnf5.

Task 5: Update all software (pacman)
Description Task 5: Update all software using the pacman package manager. The `Reboot` handler is notified after upgrade. This task is executed when the package manager is pacman.

Task 6: Configure yum
Description Task 6: Configure the yum package manager. This includes handling different versions of yum (6 vs others) and updating all software, excluding packages listed in `update_excluded_packages`. The `Reboot` handler is notified after upgrade.

Task 7: Update all software (zypper)
Description Task 7: Update all software using the zypper package manager. The `Reboot` handler is notified after upgrade. This task is executed when the package manager is zypper.


